The '''Ancestral Grounds''' are a tauren burial ground in [[Moonwhisper Coast]]. The actions of the [[Shadewalkers]] at [[An'she's Respite]] have disturbed the rest of the [[Disturbed Ancestor|Moonhoof ancestors]], causing them to rise to make their disdain known.<ref>{{questlong|Horde|56|Back to Sleep}}</ref>

